ns.</p></div><div class=\"mt-12 overflow-x-auto\"><table class=\"w-full min-w-[600px] border-collapse text-left\"><thead><tr class=\"border-b border-border\"><th class=\"py-4 pr-4 text-sm font-semibold\">State</th><th class=\"px-4 py-4 text-center text-sm font-semibold\">Filing Fee</th><th class=\"px-4 py-4 text-center text-sm font-semibold\">Annual Report</th><th class=\"px-4 py-4 text-center text-sm font-semibold\">Franchise Tax</th><th class=\"px-4 py-4 text-center text-sm font-semibold\">Processing</th><th class=\"px-4 py-4 text-center text-sm font-semibold\">Privacy</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"border-b border-border/50\"><td class=\"py-3.5 pr-4 text-sm font-medium\">Delaware</td><td class=\"px-4 py-3.5 text-center text-sm\">$<!-- -->90</td><td class=\"px-4 py-3.5 text-center text-sm\">$50</td><td class=\"px-4 py-3.5 text-center text-sm\">Min $400</td><td class=\"px-4 py-3.5 text-center text-sm\">3-5 days</td><td class=\"px-4 py-3.5 text-center text-sm\">High</td></tr><tr class=\"border-b border-border/50\"><td class=\"py-3.5 pr-4 text-sm font-medium\">Wyoming</td><td class=\"px-4 py-3.5 text-center text-sm\">$<!-- -->100</td><td class=\"px-4 py-3.5 text-center text-sm\">$60</td><td class=\"px-4 py-3.5 text-center text-sm\">Min $50</td><td class=\"px-4 py-3.5 text-center text-sm\">1-2 days</td><td class=\"px-4 py-3.5 text-center text-sm\">Very High</td></tr><tr class=\"border-b border-border/50\"><td class=\"py-3.5 pr-4 text-sm font-medium\">Texas</td><td class=\"px-4 py-3.5 text-center text-sm\">$<!-- -->300</td><td class=\"px-4 py-3.5 text-center text-sm\">$0</td><td class=\"px-4 py-3.5 text-center text-sm\">Based on revenue</td><td class=\"px-4 py-3.5 text-center text-sm\">5-7 days</td><td class=\"px-4 py-3.5 text-center text-sm\">Medium</td></tr><tr class=\"border-b border-border/50\"><td class=\"py-3.5 pr-4 text-sm font-medium\">Nevada</td><td class=\"px-4 py-3.5 text-center text-sm\">$<!-- -->425</td><td class=\"px-4 py-3.5 text-center text-sm\">$150</td><td class=\"px-4 py-3.5 text-center text-sm\">Min $200</td><td class=\"px-4 py-3.5 text-center text-sm\">3-5 days</td><td class=\"px-4 py-3.5 text-center text-sm\">High</td></tr><tr class=\"border-b border-border/50\"><td class=\"py-3.5 pr-4 text-sm font-medium\">Florida</td><td class=\"px-4 py-3.5 text-center text-sm\">$<!-- -->125</td><td class=\"px-4 py-3.5 text-center text-sm\">$138.75</td><td class=\"px-4 py-3.5 text-center text-sm\">None</td><td class=\"px-4 py-3.5 text-center text-sm\">5-7 days</td><td class=\"px-4 py-3.5 text-center text-sm\">Medium</td></tr></tbody></table></div><div class=\"mt-8\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)\"><a role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" data-slot=\"button\" class=\"group/button inline-flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-lg border bg-clip-padding text-sm font-medium whitespace-nowrap transition-all outline-none select-none focus-visible:border-ring focus-visible:ring-3 focus-visible:ring-ring/50 active:not-aria-[haspopup]:translate-y-px disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 aria-invalid:border-destructive aria-invalid:ring-3 aria-invalid:ring-destructive/20 dark:aria-invalid:border-destructive/50 dark:aria-invalid:ring-destructive/40 [&amp;_svg]:pointer-events-none [&amp;_svg]:shrink-0 [&amp;_svg:not([class*=&#x27;size-&#x27;])]:size-4 border-border bg-background hover:bg-muted hover:text-foreground aria-expanded:bg-muted aria-expanded:text-foreground dark:border-input dark:bg-input/30 dark:hover:bg-input/50 h-8 gap-1.5 px-2.5 has-data-[icon=inline-end]:pr-2 has-data-[icon=inline-start]:pl-2\" href=\"/incorporate/states\">View All States<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-right\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-icon=\"inline-end\"><path d=\"m9 18 6-6-6-6\"></path></svg></a></div></div></section><section class=\"section-pad bg-muted/30\"><div class=\"container-site max-w-3xl\"><div class=\"\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)\"><p class=\"mb-4 flex items-center justify-center gap-2 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[.22em] text-primary\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-sparkles size-3.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M11.017 2.814a1 1 0 0 1 1.966 0l1.051 5.558a2 2 0 0 0 1.594 1.594l5.558 1.051a1 1 0 0 1 0 1.966l-5.558 1.051a2 2 0 0 0-1.594 1.594l-1.051 5.558a1 1 0 0 1-1.966 0l-1.051-5.558a2 2 0 0 0-1.594-1.594l-5.558-1.051a1 1 0 0 1 0-1.966l5.558-1.051a2 2 0 0 0 1.594-1.594z\"></path><path d=\"M20 2v4\"></path><path d=\"M22 4h-4\"></path><circle cx=\"4\" cy=\"20\" r=\"2\"></circle></svg>FAQ</p><h2 class=\"text-balance text-center text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl\">Common questions.</h2></div><div class=\"mt-12 space-y-4\"><div class=\"\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)\"><div data-slot=\"card\" data-size=\"default\" class=\"group/card flex flex-col gap-(--card-spacing) overflow-hidden rounded-xl text-sm text-card-foreground ring-1 ring-foreground/10 [--card-spacing:--spacing(4)] has-data-[slot=card-footer]:pb-0 has-[&gt;img:first-child]:pt-0 data-[size=sm]:[--card-spacing:--spacing(3)] data-[size=sm]:has-data-[slot=card-footer]:pb-0 *:[img:first-child]:rounded-t-xl *:[img:last-child]:rounded-b-xl border-border bg-card p-6\"><h3 class=\"text-base font-semibold\">How long does incorporation take?</h3><p class=\"mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground\">Processing times vary by state. Most LLCs are processed within 1-7 business days. Expedited options are available for faster processing.</p></div></div><div class=\"\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)\"><div data-slot=\"card\" data-size=\"default\" class=\"group/card flex flex-col gap-(--card-spacing) overflow-hidden rounded-xl text-sm text-card-foreground ring-1 ring-foreground/10 [--card-spacing:--spacing(4)] has-data-[slot=card-footer]:pb-0 has-[&gt;img:first-child]:pt-0 data-[size=sm]:[--card-spacing:--spacing(3)] data-[size=sm]:has-data-[slot=card-footer]:pb-0 *:[img:first-child]:rounded-t-xl *:[img:last-child]:rounded-b-xl border-border bg-card p-6\"><h3 class=\"text-base font-semibold\">What&#x27;s the difference between an LLC and a corporation?</h3><p class=\"mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground\">LLCs offer flexible management and pass-through taxation, while corporations (C-Corp) are better suited for venture capital and public offerings.</p></div></div><div class=\"\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)\"><div data-slot=\"card\" data-size=\"default\" class=\"group/card flex flex-col gap-(--card-spacing) overflow-hidden rounded-xl text-sm text-card-foreground ring-1 ring-foreground/10 [--card-spacing:--spacing(4)] has-data-[slot=card-footer]:pb-0 has-[&gt;img:first-child]:pt-0 data-[size=sm]:[--card-spacing:--spacing(3)] data-[size=sm]:has-data-[slot=card-footer]:pb-0 *:[img:first-child]:rounded-t-xl *:[img:last-child]:rounded-b-xl border-border bg-card p-6\"><h3 class=\"text-base font-semibold\">Can international founders incorporate in the US?</h3><p class=\"mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground\">Yes. We help non-US residents form LLCs and corporations in any state. We also provide ITIN assistance and business banking guidance.</p></div></div><div class=\"\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)\"><div data-slot=\"card\" data-size=\"default\" class=\"group/card flex flex-col gap-(--card-spacing) overflow-hidden rounded-xl text-sm text-card-foreground ring-1 ring-foreground/10 [--card-spacing:--spacing(4)] has-data-[slot=card-footer]:pb-0 has-[&gt;img:first-child]:pt-0 data-[size=sm]:[--card-spacing:--spacing(3)] data-[size=sm]:has-data-[slot=card-footer]:pb-0 *:[img:first-child]:rounded-t-xl *:[img:last-child]:rounded-b-xl border-border bg-card p-6\"><h3 class=\"text-base font-semibold\">Do I need a registered agent?</h3><p class=\"mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground\">Yes, every US company needs a registered agent. Our Professional and Premium plans include registered agent service for the first year.</p></div></div><div class=\"\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)\"><div data-slot=\"card\" data-size=\"default\" class=\"group/card flex flex-col gap-(--card-spacing) overflow-hidden rounded-xl text-sm text-card-foreground ring-1 ring-foreground/10 [--card-spacing:--spacing(4)] has-data-[slot=card-footer]:pb-0 has-[&gt;img:first-child]:pt-0 data-[size=sm]:[--card-spacing:--spacing(3)] data-[size=sm]:has-data-[slot=card-footer]:pb-0 *:[img:first-child]:rounded-t-xl *:[img:last-child]:rounded-b-xl border-border bg-card p-6\"><h3 class=\"text-base font-semibold\">What is a virtual business address?</h3><p class=\"mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground\">A virtual address gives you a prestigious US business address for receiving mail. Mail can be forwarded or scanned to you anywhere.</p></div></div><div class=\"\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)\"><div data-slot=\"card\" data-size=\"default\" class=\"group/card flex flex-col gap-(--card-spacing) overflow-hidden rounded-xl text-sm text-card-foreground ring-1 ring-foreground/10 [--card-spacing:--spacing(4)] has-data-[slot=card-footer]:pb-0 has-[&gt;img:first-child]:pt-0 data-[size=sm]:[--card-spacing:--spacing(3)] data-[size=sm]:has-data-[slot=card-footer]:pb-0 *:[img:first-child]:rounded-t-xl *:[img:last-child]:rounded-b-xl border-border bg-card p-6\"><h3 class=\"text-base font-semibold\">What state should I choose?</h3><p class=\"mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground\">The best state depends on your needs. Wyoming and Delaware are popular for privacy and tax benefits. Use our state comparison tool to find the right fit.</p></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"section-pad\"><div class=\"container-site\"><div class=\"text-center\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)\"><p class=\"mb-4 flex items-center justify-center gap-2 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[.22em] text-primary\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-sparkles size-3.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M11.017 2.814a1 1 0 0 1 1.966 0l1.051 5.558a2 2 0 0 0 1.594 1.594l5.558 1.051a1 1 0 0 1 0 1.966l-5.558 1.051a2 2 0 0 0-1.594 1.594l-1.051 5.558a1 1 0 0 1-1.966 0l-1.051-5.558a2 2 0 0 0-1.594-1.594l-5.558-1.051a1 1 0 0 1 0-1.966l5.558-1.051a2 2 0 0 0 1.594-1.594z\"></path><path d=\"M20 2v4\"></path><path d=\"M22 4h-4\"></path><circle cx=\"4\" cy=\"20\" r=\"2\"></circle></svg>Trusted by Founders</p><h2 class=\"text-balance text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl\">What our clients say.</h2></div><div class=\"mt-12 grid gap-5 lg:grid-cols-3\"><div class=\"\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)\"><div data-slot=\"card\" data-size=\"default\" class=\"group/card flex flex-col gap-(--card-spacing) overflow-hidden rounded-xl text-sm text-card-foreground ring-1 ring-foreground/10 [--card-spacing:--spacing(4)] has-data-[slot=card-footer]:pb-0 has-[&gt;img:first-child]:pt-0 data-[size=sm]:[--card-spacing:--spacing(3)] data-[size=sm]:has-data-[slot=card-footer]:pb-0 *:[img:first-child]:rounded-t-xl *:[img:last-child]:rounded-b-xl border-border bg-card p-7\"><div class=\"flex gap-0.5\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-star size-4 fill-primary text-primary\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M11.525 2.2